OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny cloud and patchy rain at
OL,6,Ffirst will soon clear to leave bright
OL,7,Fspells. Chance of the odd afternoon
OL,8,Fshower. the best of the brightness
OL,9,Fwill be towards North Aberdeenshire.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClouding over during the
OL,12,Fevening and mainly dry but some light
OL,13,Fand patchy rain forming towards dawn,
OL,14,Fespecially for western Aberdeenshire.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FCloudy with outbreaks of light
OL,17,Fand patchy rain and drizzle, best of
OL,18,Fany bright weather for north
OL,19,FAberdeenshire, a few heavier showers
OL,20,Fin the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
